    "offering_evidence_count": 12,
    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following the satisfactory completion of development work and any related pilot project, an interested customer would then enter into a sales agreement with us, pursuant to which we would either: (i) agree to manufacture products to the customer’s specifications from time to time as requested by the customer, including subject to potential minimum quantity requirements;",
        "start_character": 15331,
        "end_character": 15703
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Once we have identified a specific application requirement, we expect to proceed with development work through an understanding of the product specifications and engineering work to calculate the size and capabilities of pixel OTFTs and storage capacitors.",
        "start_character": 10031,
        "end_character": 10287
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design and develop our materials at our research and development facility in Manchester, UK, and provide prototyping services at the Centre for Process Innovation in Sedgefield, UK.",
        "start_character": 691,
        "end_character": 875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also entered into several joint development agreements to demonstrate the capabilities of our materials and to show the feasibility of utilizing our products in specific applications.",
        "start_character": 14221,
        "end_character": 14412
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Also in February 2024, we entered into a collaboration agreement with FlexiIC to develop low-cost, rapid turnaround custom circuits using organic transistor technology.",
        "start_character": 20988,
        "end_character": 21156
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of this development, we expect to populate a library of reference designs for common gates used in digital electronic circuits to further simplify third-party design processes.",
        "start_character": 9762,
        "end_character": 9946
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2023, we began developing a range of customized dielectric inks for customers’ advanced electronics packaging applications.",
        "start_character": 2792,
        "end_character": 2922
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For commercial supply quantities, to avoid the shipping costs associated with large quantities of locally available solvents, we expect to supply fully formulated ink to customers from a formulation facility located close to the customer’s manufacturing facility.",
        "start_character": 24013,
        "end_character": 24276
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, the solubility of our inks would permit customers to digitally print the features of the OTFT device, which we believe may be attractive to potential customers seeking to lower manufacturing costs.",
        "start_character": 11665,
        "end_character": 11875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2022, we entered into a joint development agreement with a Taiwan-based company for the development of a new generation of MiniLED signage.",
        "start_character": 19452,
        "end_character": 19594
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2023, we entered into a joint development agreement with a company in Taiwan for the development of a MicroLED-based display using our OTFT backplane.",
        "start_character": 19731,
        "end_character": 19884
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-040562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-040562-906f0ee3ddbd3604",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-040562",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2023, we entered into a transfer technology agreement with ITRI pursuant to which ITRI is developing Gen 2.5 scale (370mm x 470mm) commercial manufacturing processes for a range of our OTFT materials.",
        "start_character": 12122,
        "end_character": 12325
      }
    ]
